-- 222: SG footer (block_id = 1) Information/Enquires columns:
--   * Remove 'Contact Us' from the Information column
--   * Replace 'Tertiary Courses GPT' in the Enquires column with 'Contact Us'
--   Byte-exact REPLACE() via hex generated from the live block. The Information
